{
  "name": "Divine Smite",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you hit a creature with a melee weapon attack, you can expend one spell slot to deal radiant damage to the target, in addition to the weapon's damage. The extra damage is 2d8 for a 1st-level spell slot, plus 1d8 for each spell level higher than 1st, to a maximum of 6d8. The damage increases by 1d8 if the target is an undead or a fiend, to a maximum of 7d8.</p><p>You can use this feature without expending a spell slot a number of times equal to half your Proficiency (rounded down) and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</p>",
